# This repository is public. Track only the backups and the code that makes
# them; everything else is ignored so it can't be committed by accident.
# Add a new file here deliberately, after checking it belongs in public.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/AGENTS.md
!/CLAUDE.md
!/README
!/backup.py
!/scripts/
!/launchd/
!/*-backup-readable.txt
!/*-backup-track-urls.txt
__pycache__/
.DS_Store
